# Goal: tag creates immutable named revisions and lists them in name order.
> init
<<<
D DATE "Date: \w{3} \w{3} \d{2} \d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2} \d{4} [-+]\d{4}"
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "first"
<<<
> log
===
commit ([a-f0-9]{40})
${DATE}
first

===
commit [a-f0-9]{40}
${DATE}
initial commit

<<<*
D FIRST "${1}"
> tag release
<<<
> tag alpha ${FIRST}
<<<
> tag
alpha ${FIRST}
release ${FIRST}
<<<
